<title>INDONESIA: Indocement to pay 70 rph dividend for 96.</title>
<headline>Indocement to pay 70 rph dividend for 96.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indocement Tunggal Prakarsa, one of Indonesia's largest cement firms, will pay a 70 rupiah dividend for 1996, the company said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the figure was approved at a shareholders meeting earlier in the day.</p>
<p>The company paid a total dividend of 160 rupiah in 1995.</p>
</text>
